cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use open-twin in your work, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "open-twin: health-data connectors to FHIR R4"
abstract: >-
  A collection of connectors that translate wearable, body-scanner, clinical and
  genomic data into FHIR R4 bundles, with a reconciliation layer that keeps every
  source value and abstains where the evidence does not support a choice.
  Conceived as an open connector repository in analogy to Bioconductor.
